\cb3 Tuesday : Trying to understand the Cyber threats and Vulnerabilities concepts and rubric tasks took most of the time. I could do part of task 1 and understood the scenario for the other tasks. Installed Virtual machine(UTM) Kali Linux to work on the assignment where I have to perform the demonstration to Identify and Analyze Cyber Threats. Under that I did the creation of 1 Phishing template using Social Engineering Tookit(SET) in Kali Linux. The activities learnt on Tuesday were Implement Threat Intelligence Principles Under Cyber Security and overall Technical activity was continuing to learn about markdown language, its syntax, usage in GitHub and how README files are useful and a good practice to be included in our folders and work. While I am supposed to be done with the task and also work on the project I was partly done with the first task of Identify and Analyze Cyber Threats. Educators and peers are helping but it's just taking time to comprehend things and implementing real time.\cb1 \
\cb3 Wednesday : Continued to work on the task to demonstrate understanding of cyber threats through practical analysis, for which I need to include analysis of a malware sample using VirusTotal or Any.Run/Hybrid Analysis platform along with documenting detection results, behavioral indicators, and potential impact. I have implemented this task on the virtual environment on Kali Linux platform and got the results have to get the feedback from the educators on that to proceed with the next step. We had two activities ran by the Educators.One is under Cyber domain which was the explanation of next tasks Develop and Apply Risk Management Strategies and Implement Security Monitoring and Incidence Response. We started to learn more about Unix Terminal commands/ Command prompt its uses and functionalities and features exploring along. Trying to finish the task and move on to the next but still working on it.\cb1 \
\cb3 Thursday : Here comes the end of this week 3 time for status updates. As we continue to do the activity on Unix learning more features and implementation we also trying to get to the next tasks in rubric along with project progress. I have to finish the setup of users roles and environment on Keycloak and learn to integrate Microsoft Entra id and get to the next tasks of Cyber Threats and Vulnerabilities Assignment. Make use of rest of the week to get on track speeding up with concepts learning and implementation.\cb1 \
